<title>FRANCE: Alcatel &quot;notes&quot; Thomson decision.</title>
<headline>Alcatel &quot;notes&quot; Thomson decision.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said it a statement it &quot;noted&quot; the Prime Minister's preference for Lagardere Groupe in the privatisation of Thomson SA.</p>
<p>&quot;Alcatel Alsthom hopes that the chosen solution will preserve the long-term strategic interests of the French and European defence industrie as well as the technologies developed in the multimedia sector,&quot; Alcatel said in a statement.</p>
<p>Alcatel said it was continuing its talks with the French authorities and its joint-venture partner GEC Plc concerning a merger between GEC Alsthom and state-controlled nuclear engineering group Framatome.</p>
</text>
